# AngelScript: AngelScript manual: Script language reference; requirements/languages/angelscript.md
name     angelscript as
keyword  and abstract auto break case cast class const continue default do else enum explicit external
keyword  final for from funcdef function get if import in inout interface mixin namespace not null or
keyword  out override private property protected return set shared super switch this typedef while xor
type     void bool int int8 int16 int32 int64 uint uint8 float double string array dictionary
builtin  true false print
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   """ """  : multiline
string   " "      : escapes
string   ' '      : escapes
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.@
calls
